###### II. Squad Registration
**Fields:**
- Username (unique system wide, but this validation can include numeral, for example: CristianoRonaldo7 == helps players assign their positions/numbers to their usernames)
- Full Name i.e First Name, Last Name (required but not unique)... Middle Name (can be null)
- Date of Birth (DD/MM/YYYY; with boundary checks)
- Citizenship (validated against known country list)
- Position (the entered position will be checked against pre-defined standard football positions, but should include helper message)
- Strong Foot (Left or Right only; validation enforced)
- Jersey Number (must be unique within the same team)
- Nickname (optional)
- **Team Level**: Auto-calculated backend field based on DOB (e.g. U13, U15, U19, U21)
- Profile Picture (Max 2MB)
- Market Value (in ZAR; arbitrary sentiment-based)

**Validation Examples:**
- Rejection of unknown countries or non-standard positions
- Invalid date formats (e.g. future dates, ages over 100)
- Duplicate jersey numbers within the same team

**Expected Backend Behavior:**
- Auto-classify and return Team Level from DOB
- All validated data stored under one team object (Team → Squad[])
- Save triggers confirmation or inline validation feedback

